### 1) Kayıt ol
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "hazal@example.com", "password": "Test1234" }

### 2) Giriş yap (dönen "token" değerini kopyala)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "hazal@example.com", "password": "Test1234" }

### 3) Token'ı buraya yapıştır
@token = BURAYA_TOKEN

### Token'sız istek -> 401
GET {{host}}/api/jobapplications

### Token'lı istek -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/jobapplications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Token'lı başvuru ekle
POST {{host}}/api/jobapplications
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "companyName": "Örnek Teknoloji", "position": "Frontend Developer" }
